<section class="faq g-paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-top">
      <div class="faq-aside">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="tick">\</span> 03 · Questions</div>
        <h2 style="--d:60ms">Before you send a batch.</h2>
        <div class="faq-ask">
          <p class="faq-ask-q">Didn’t see yours?</p><a href="/__v9/contact?service=iaas"
            >Ask us <span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item" name="iaas-faq" open>
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>What does it cost?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                A fee per interview, plus a success fee if you hire someone we interviewed. We quote after the first
                call, once we know the role and the batch size.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" name="iaas-faq">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>Who runs the interviews?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                Senior experts who have done the job, more than fifty of them across the sectors we cover. You see each
                interviewer’s name and background on the write-up.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" name="iaas-faq">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>Can our own panel still run the final round?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                Yes. We replace the screening rounds, not your decision. Your panel meets the people who cleared the
                bar, with our notes in hand.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" name="iaas-faq">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>Where do the candidates come from?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                Anywhere: your recruiters, agencies, referrals, your careers page. Scoring everyone against the same bar
                is the point, so you can also see which source sends people who clear it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" name="iaas-faq">
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>Is it recorded?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                Yes, with the candidate’s consent. The recording and transcript come with every write-up. Data stays in
                India and is deleted on request.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" name="iaas-faq">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>How many candidates can we send?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a"><div><p>Three or thirty. A typical batch comes back in about 48 hours.</p></div></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
